			<div class="content" id="post-content-242942">
									

<p>I like people who ask the hard questions…</p>
<p>It does nothing. It just touches you, and stays there until you move, in which case it starts following you. I need to do an edit as well, I think, as it appears I was unclear about the distances. If you move more than ten yards away, it will blip to within seven feet of you. If you are inside that ten yard radius, it will keep blipping one foot towards you every hour.</p>
<p>I guess the thing I was shooting for with this was paranoia. This thing will be with you forever, until you die or come damn close. Work, school, dates, anywhere, this thing will be with you. How do you explain that? It could start to work your nerves after a while.</p>
<p>This is one I tried hard on, but I feel I missed the mark. I wanted to make a Safe item that was still creepy and unsettling. If people think it’s a good idea, I’ll run an edit on it and see if I can’t make it a little more interesting.</p>

							</div>

								
					
